ucture and formatting:\n\n**Key features:**\n- Removes `<script>` tags and their content entirely\n- Removes event handler attributes (`onclick`, `onload`, `onmouseover`, etc.)\n- Neutralizes `javascript:` URLs in `href`, `src`, and `action` attributes by replacing them with empty values\n- Preserves all formatting, whitespace, tables, headers, and non-dangerous HTML attributes\n- Uses regex patterns for surgical removal of only dangerous code\n- Modifies the file in-place\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\npython filter.py <html_file>\n```\n\nThe script reads the HTML file, removes all JavaScript and XSS attack vectors, and writes the cleaned version back to the same file.","ttft_ms":29960,"type":"result","duration_ms":33574,"uuid":"d4ae1f08-b378-472c-aff7-fc4cd416ac31","ttft_stream_ms":691,"time_to_request_ms":82,"queued_turn_count":0}
